# sys-turnback-routing, the third pillar (decomp ScrCmd_InitTurnbackCave). The seeded
# walk from Sendoff Spring is tests/integration/m6-turnback.rom.test.ts. A constructed start: two
# pillars seen, the player at the pillar room's south door (its onTransition adds the third pillar and a room).
# Three pillars: every door but the one the player came by leads to the Giratina room. The Giratina room has no
# init_turnback_cave: its doors keep the ROM's targets, the entrance, whose onTransition clears both counters.
# Out by the entrance's south door to Sendoff Spring.
set var platinum:VAR_TURNBACK_CAVE_PILLARS_SEEN 2
set var platinum:VAR_TURNBACK_CAVE_ROOMS_VISITED 7
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_TURNBACK_CAVE_PILLAR_ROOM 11 20 up
until idle
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_TURNBACK_CAVE_PILLARS_SEEN 3
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_TURNBACK_CAVE_ROOMS_VISITED 8
# The west door (2,11): up a row, left to the aisle, up to the door's row, then left into it.
+0 press up
until position 11 19
+0 release up
+0 press left
until position 3 19
+0 release left
+0 press up
until position 3 11
+0 release up
+0 press left
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_TURNBACK_CAVE_GIRATINA_ROOM" 300
+0 release left
until idle 300
+0 assert position platinum:MAP_HEADER_TURNBACK_CAVE_GIRATINA_ROOM 20 11
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_TURNBACK_CAVE_PILLARS_SEEN 3
# Back by the east door: the entrance (ROM target), counters cleared.
+0 press right
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_TURNBACK_CAVE_ENTRANCE" 300
+0 release right
until idle 300
+0 assert position platinum:MAP_HEADER_TURNBACK_CAVE_ENTRANCE 2 11
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_TURNBACK_CAVE_PILLARS_SEEN 0
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_TURNBACK_CAVE_ROOMS_VISITED 0
# Out to Sendoff Spring: up the west aisle, through the gap at the top, round the inscription to its south door (11,16).
+0 press right
until position 3 11
+0 release right
+0 press up
until position 3 3
+0 release up
+0 press right
until position 11 3
+0 release right
+0 press down
until position 11 12
+0 release down
+0 press left
until position 7 12
+0 release left
+0 press down
until position 7 15
+0 release down
+0 press right
until position 11 15
+0 release right
+0 press down
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_SENDOFF_SPRING" 300
+0 release down
until idle 300
+0 assert map platinum:MAP_HEADER_SENDOFF_SPRING
